note contract 5 layout lines 154, 158 with erratum E5: a field with COUNT omitted is a scalar,
note written `put c F v` and read `get c F` without an index. stdout: 01 02 03 04, then 0000000001020304 (exp/l5-scalar.out).
om2
layout one 4
field v uint at 0 big
end
fn fill x edit one to void
put x v 0x01020304
end
fn show x view one to void
puth ulong get x v
end
fn main to int
c = new uchar 4 0
fill c
w = write 1 c 0 4
show c
ret 0
end
